data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":92,"item_id":"rs_0c7e608aa770446a016acad6570c5481948abe6d6aca759c0b","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Planning tests for the server**\n\nI'm considering implementing straightforward tests for the server. It seems I should add separate tests in the same file, running them sequentially. This way, I can ensure everything functions correctly. I also want to harness support for default writes and posts. Organizing the tests will help me manage the code better and catch any issues early. I’ll focus on keeping the process simple yet effective. Let's make sure to check everything thoroughly!"}

